5-13-88Default for update rate works. zero defaults to 500._AllocGen returns an error if the N.Synth hasn't been started yet.N.Synth now polls MIDI so that midi input should never be lost when playing notes._NSStartUp returns err $1925 SoundWrongVer if the SoundTools is a earlyer version than 2.3P.5-26-88Added one additional polling place in Note On, for NoteSeq.7/9?/88Added two new tool calls NSSetUpdateRate and NSSetUserUpdateRtn.7/12/88Don't use scratch (F0-f2 of ST DP) in S.Tools ZP any more.Disable interupts when writing to DOC Glue in NSStartup.Get NewHandle for Priority_table and vcb_ram.No more VCB of DOC proc's they were just equates that have been moved.No more need for MyData Proc either.No need for VCB.aii file anymore.alloc:still uses part of sound tools direct page.min      equ  $F4                       ; At these addressesall changes from 7/12/88 to 7/21/88 have been made just to make the note synth romable.7/21/88 New branch created for Romable changes.7/25/88 Using E16.MIDI equates for MIDIInputPoll vector.